  Schema-shaped, not a fully XSD-valid instance. See
  docs/auth-messages/sftr-auth079.md.

  auth.079 has no header and no per-trade status element (a record in a
  TSR IS outstanding). SFT type is derived from the
  TransactionLoanData31Choice wrapper (RpTrad->REPO, BuySellBck->BSBC,
  SctiesLndg->SLEB, MrgnLndg->MGLD). collateral_portfolio_code is not
  mappable from auth.079 (documented), so MGLD records with
  AvlblForCollReuse=true fire SFTR.MSR.MGLD_REUSE_REQUIRES_PORTFOLIO.
  Each <Stat> exercises a SFTR.TST.* / SFTR.MSR.MGLD_* check.
-->
